 193:../../diagnostics/firmware/src/diag_core.h ****     // Handles one valid frame body. Writes a reply body into `reply` (left empty
 194:../../diagnostics/firmware/src/diag_core.h ****     // when there is nothing to answer) and returns a mask of Request flags.
